id: DRAFT-libopaque-1.0.1-munit-tmpfile-redirect-tmpdir-shim
trigger_tool: conan|cc|ctest
phase: testing
error_signature: unable to create buffer for stderr: Permission denied \(13\)|tmpfile.*Permission denied
severity: 3
category: libc, musl, posix, testing, ohos, compat
match_keywords: tmpfile, readonly_tmp, temporary_directory_readonly, munit, stderr, TMPDIR, hmbs_tmpfile
title: 只读/tmp下munit经tmpfile缓冲stderr失败时构建期-Dtmpfile重定向到TMPDIR兼容
root_cause: OHOS libc tmpfile硬编码/tmp并忽略TMPDIR且真机/tmp只读报EACCES而munit每例调用tmpfile缓冲stderr失败即MUNIT_ERROR致32例全error
verification_cmd: 真机preflight日志应显示HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT status passed discovered 33 executed 33 passed 33 failed 0 skipped 0且command为./opaque-test && ./opaque-munit --fatal-failures
affected_scope: 上游测试框架经tmpfile缓冲输出且真机/tmp只读报EACCES的C库munit矩阵用例场景
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: tmpfile-redirect-to-tmpdir-shim
rec_description: 构建期生成TMPDIR感知的hmbs_tmpfile shim经mkstemp加unlink加fdopen实现仅对munit目标加-Dtmpfile等于hmbs_tmpfile重定向库源码与归档产物不动33/33通过验证为跨库可复用模式
rec_command: conanfile.py新增_build_tmpfile_shim生成hmbs_tmpfile_shim.c并在_link_test仅对munit目标加-Dtmpfile=hmbs_tmpfile后链接该对象加notes.md记录
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-only
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: patch-harness-to-mkstemp-tmpdir
fallback_description: 若无法用-D别名重定向则补丁测试harness改用mkstemp加TMPDIR加fdopen显式创建缓冲并保留32例全量不断言跳过
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"discovered":1[^}]*"status":"passed"
forbid_1_reason: 禁止仅跑1个end-to-end而丢弃32个munit矩阵用例后标记通过必须保持33全量
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检evidence incomplete任务退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-readonly-tmp-mktemp-getcwd-guard-umask]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libopaque-1.0.1-munit-tmpfile-redirect-tmpdir-shim.md
last_updated: 2026-09-18
source_event: libopaque/1.0.1真机预检munit经tmpfile缓冲stderr失败并修复为TMPDIR兼容shim后33/33通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 10635
